Subject: [PATCH] the 2026-11-06 bug hunt's fixes on 2 x DGX Spark (both ranks)

On top of 0058 (the bundle-8 tree), the fixes of a read-only bug hunt over the served engine (bundle 9): server
input that could crash or mis-tokenize, picture decoding without bounds, lifecycle and recovery gaps. Every change
CPU-tested (red copies of the old code fail), source-reviewed, and A/B-checked on the GPU pair: 92/92 replies exact
against bundle 8, decode within 0.3 % (research/LOCAL-STACK-20261106.md, "Bundle 9"). Rank 1 ran a follower built
from this tree in that check. Generated with `git diff --binary` in a checkout of the 0058 tree; `git apply` of it
gives the served source file for file (1286 files, sha256-compared).

